{"2774370":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Vanishing Starlight 星烬 烛耀山海","steam_appid":2774370,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[3841650],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras\/92ad646c41960be5b70cf33161cf19b9.avif?t=1774524311\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras_big\/92ad646c41960be5b70cf33161cf19b9.avif?t=1774524311 width=800 height=458 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Backstory<\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boundless barrens veil like a celestial prison. In the darkness forged by the unyielding law, planets adrift like faint candle flames, spinning, guttering.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A death-sentenced prisoner who lost his memory escapes from the realm of prison: Gibetuary. On the journey, travel through the eerie realms like Ignysium and Tidesong, witness the peoples struggling for survival while reuniting the long-lost allies and reclaim everything they have torn away.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind the veil of these realms, traces of the Gods loom near. Seemingly, they are capable of spurring the evolution of a people like miracles. Yet with absolute indifference, they may wipe out a realm’s value.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are they?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nurturers? Overseers? Or executioners?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are they gods who answer prayers, or the nemesis of all who strive for their people’s survival?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When a condemned soul stands at the threshold of a darkened future, facing those deities who temper fates—can he still voice his questions?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who am I?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How come my crime?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why was I born… and why must I die?<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras\/83fd5817d4141e613898fa99516f0e76.poster.avif?t=1774524311\" width=606 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras\/83fd5817d4141e613898fa99516f0e76.mp4?t=1774524311\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Brand-new Experience<\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling non-stop combo<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock weapons, learn skills, customize your own fight style with various chips<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras\/9d9c7374a9d87223da57333a4b975775.poster.avif?t=1774524311\" width=606 height=342 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2774370\/extras\/9d9c7374a9d87223da57333a4b975775.mp4?t=1774524311\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Sci-fi style Chinese mythologies<\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Chinese mythological characters in a sci-fi world<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore with Xingtian and Nubris. Fight against Kuafu and Ilona<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><